WEBVTT

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:14.240
Oh, Kurosaki-san.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:17.580
Oh. Hello, Shameless-senpai!

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:21.160
Who are you calling shameless!?

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:21.950
Eh?

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:25.210
But you're always saying "Shameless! Shameless!" aren't you?

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:30.340
Could it be that you actually want to try something shameless?

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:33.260
Your figure is sexy, too.

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:36.640
W-What did you say?!

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.060
Hey, hey. Kotegawa-san, calm down.

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:41.520
D-Don't try to stop me, Sairenji-san!

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:44.020
She needs some educational guidance!

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:46.150
Hello, Haruna-senpai!

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:47.650
Is Maron doing well?

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:49.270
Yes, he's doing well.

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:52.860
But recently he's getting fat, so I'm making him go on a diet.

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:57.530
Shameless-senpai, why don't you let Maron lick you?

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:01.910
Shameless!

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:08.290
Mea-san is like that, but she has some
surprisingly good parts too, doesn't she?

00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:13.420
If I make an effort, I wonder if I'll be able to get along with her as well?

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:27.480
Why is Momo doing something like that?

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:30.980
Damn it.

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:56.300
<b>fushigi na yasuragi kanshou</b>

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:56.300
<b>不思議な安らぎ観賞</b>

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:56.300
<b>This strange feeling of peaceful enjoyment</b>

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:58.880
<b>shibaraku kono mama</b>

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:58.880
<b>しばらくこのまま</b>

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:58.880
<b>Will continue for a while</b>

00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:03.470
<b>rikai funou puroburemubousou</b>

00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:03.470
<b>理解不能プロブレム暴走</b>

00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:03.470
<b>An impossible to solve problem runs wild</b>

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:06.770
<b>genin wa?</b>

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:06.770
<b>原因は？</b>

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:06.770
<b>And the cause is?</b>

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:13.230
<b>kimi to iru to kudaranai oshie wasureru</b>

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:13.230
<b>君といるとくだらない教え忘れる</b>

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:13.230
<b>Whenever I'm with you, I forget all about these boring lessons</b>

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:21.030
<b>kono henka kara umaretahonshin ukeireyou</b>

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:21.030
<b>この変化から生まれた本心受け入れよう</b>

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:21.030
<b>I want you to accept the true feelings born from this change</b>

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:24.990
<b>harimegutta saisho no kokoro</b>

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:24.990
<b>張り巡った最初の心</b>

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:24.990
<b>I reeled in the first heart I could hook</b>

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:28.460
<b>taguriyose sotto seebushita</b>

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:28.460
<b>手繰り寄せそっとセーブした</b>

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:28.460
<b>Carefully saving it</b>

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:33.090
<b>hyouteki ni fukuzatsu na mune no yami takushite</b>

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:33.090
<b>標的に複雑な胸の闇託して</b>

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:33.090
<b>I use the complicated darkness in my heart on my target</b>

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:36.170
<b>Care me! Care me! Care me! Care me!</b>

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:36.170
<b></b>

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:36.170
<b></b>

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:42.180
<b>naiteru kokoro atatamete yatto kizuita</b>

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:42.180
<b>泣いてる心温めてやっと気づいた</b>

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:42.180
<b>As I warmed the crying heart, I finally realised</b>

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:51.020
<b>watashi no himitsu heiki wa nani yori mo tsuyoku katakumusunda</b>

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:51.020
<b>私の秘密兵器はなによりも強く硬く結んだ</b>

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:51.020
<b>That more than anything, my secret weapon is strongly, firmly bound</b>

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:54.270
<b>kimi to no tsunagari</b>

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:54.270
<b>君との繋がり</b>

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:54.270
<b>With my connection to you</b>

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:06.230
