00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:06.230
<b>m 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 117 286 143 269 181 273 b 153 295 177 318 193 314 b 176 321 172 328 172 342 b 166 328 152 327 142 348 b 150 304 130 304 97 324  </b>

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:06.230
<b>「True character</b>

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:06.230
<b>「True character</b>

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:06.230
<b>~Identity Revealed!?~」</b>

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:06.230
<b>~Identity Revealed!?~」</b>

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:04.660
Harem Plan?!

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:07.080
You're planning something like that?!

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:08.290
That's right.

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:10.460
But of course, it's a secret from everyone.

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:14.250
Hey, there's no way you can do something like that!

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:18.880
Rito is big sister's fiancée candidate, so playing games like that...!

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:20.300
It's not a game.

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:20.970
Eh?

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:23.260
I'm serious.

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:29.230
This is the only way for me as the third princess to make
my love come true without causing trouble for everyone.

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:32.730
What about you, Nana?

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:36.610
How deep are your feelings for Rito-san?

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:42.240
Here you go!

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:43.910
Mea...

00:03:43.910 --> 00:03:45.030
What's wrong?

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:47.160
You look a little down.

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:49.080
It was something with Momo...

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.290
A fight?

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:54.500
Mea, I'm going to ask you something strange.

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:57.210
There are harems, right?

00:03:57.210 --> 00:04:00.340
The thing where a man gets along with lots of women.

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:04.390
W-What do you think of that kind of thing?

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:07.430
Are you talking about the Harem Plan?

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:09.140
Did Momo-chan tell you about it?

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:09.890
Eh?

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:11.770
So you knew about it?

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:12.850
Ah, yeah.

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:15.810
I didn't hear it from her directly, though.

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:18.900
I found out when I used Psycho Dive on Rito-senpai.

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:24.570
I see... Momo-chan was doing something like that.

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:25.410
Yeah.

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:27.490
It's stupid, isn't it?

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:28.780
It's fine, isn't it?

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:31.410
A Harem Plan sounds like fun.

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:34.670
You might be able to spend every day having fun with Rito-senpai.

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:37.670
Having fun?

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:38.790
What kind?

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:41.710
Let's see... something like this?

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:52.270
Nana.

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:52.980
Eh?

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:58.400
I'll lick you all day long today.

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:00.780
Wai-! He-!

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:01.650
Lick!

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:04.570
No!

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:06.780
Wai-!

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:07.870
Lick, lick!

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:09.490
Lick!

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:10.790
Ah, no!

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:12.580
Lick, Lick...

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:18.130
Stop making me see strange things!

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:19.250
Sorry, sorry!

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:23.760
I-In any case, I'm definitely opposed to a harem!

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:24.840
Is that so?

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:26.260
That's right!

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:29.140
In the first place, I don't have any feelings for Rito.

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:31.760
He's big sister's fiancée candidate, too.

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:34.180
Nana-chan, you're so serious, too.

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:35.020
Too?

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:39.650
More importantly, is it okay for you to be using your abilities here?

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:40.480
Hmm?

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:41.770
It's fine.

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:45.280
I used it in a way that people wouldn't know even if they saw it, right?

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:49.700
So you're still keeping it a secret, as I thought.

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:55.200
I don't think there's anyone here you especially need to worry about even if your identity was revealed, Mea.

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:03.300
I wonder what she's talking about to Nana-san.

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:10.800
Nana-san, Tearju-sensei and Yami-san are all trying to get along with Mea-san.

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:19.770
Mea! Look, look!

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:22.360
These sweets look really delicious!

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:23.270
Let me see, let me see.

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:25.990
Ah! It's true!

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:27.650
It looks really delicious-

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:29.150
It seems like she has quite a few friends in her class, as well.

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:34.030
If I want to talk about my intentions, doing it alone is best, right?

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:37.660
Hm?

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:40.790
Celine, what's that?

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:44.750
It's one of Lala's inventions.

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:47.460
She said it's called Go-Go-Vacuum-Kun-Anglerfish.

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:50.720
Celine knocked over a garbage bin, so...

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:54.220
Lala happened to be there, so she made it right then.

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:59.640
I was afraid it would be another failure, but this is pretty amazing!

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:02.520
It has an automatic sensor, so it only sucks up garbage-

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:04.770
Is something wrong?

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:05.860
I...

00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:09.820
I'll never approve of a harem!

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:12.700
Did you hear about it from Momo?

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:13.530
Yes, I heard!

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:14.330
I heard it all!

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:16.120
You damn playboy!

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:31.130
Tearju-sensei!?

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:32.720
Oshizu-chan...

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:34.430
What is it, so suddenly?

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:35.260
H-Huh?

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:36.930
I'm sorry.

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:39.560
Did Mea-san come this way?

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:40.520
Eh?

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:42.020
I haven't seen her.

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:43.600
That's strange.

00:07:58.740 --> 00:07:59.750
Hm?

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:00.960
What happened?

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:06.960
Geez Murasame-senpai, you're overreacting!

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:14.340
Please stop playing pranks!

00:08:14.340 --> 00:08:17.010
I'm not particularly playing a prank.

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:19.010
Hey, Murasame-senpai.

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:21.270
Would you stop secretly following me around?

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:25.650
It makes me want to counter you because of my old habits.

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:30.440
So, did you need something from me?

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:32.030
Ah, huh?

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:33.900
You don't have something to talk about?

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:35.910
I don't.

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:40.910
I... I hate you, after all.

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:42.660
I see...

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:48.420
I don't hate you, Murasame-senpai.

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:52.380
You're so easy to tease.

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:58.300
And also, you know the real me, right senpai?

00:08:58.300 --> 00:08:59.930
So I can take it easy.

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:05.440
Like Nana-chan and Momo-chan, I can talk to you as myself.

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:09.360
Then, why are you hiding your identity...?

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:15.450
If being yourself is easier, why don't you just reveal it?

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:26.420
It's true, I was originally here for a mission to examine Yami-oneechan's environment.

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:31.000
But now there's no reason to continue pretending to be an Earthling.

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:36.880
Yet... I don't want to abandon her... Kurosaki Mea.

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:44.480
I feel like the moment I abandon her, everything I have obtained up until now will crumble away.

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:50.310
That voice just now was...!

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:55.320
W-Why is it chasing me?!

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:56.450
Nana!

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:57.950
Cleaning.

00:09:57.950 --> 00:10:00.450
Vacuum target confirmed.

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:08.670
Is it broken?

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:14.380
Completed.

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:24.600
Huh?

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:27.730
Y-You beast!

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:29.600
I- I didn't see! I didn't see anything!

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:29.600
Oh my, are you fighting?

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:32.900
Don't say you didn't see anything! I know you did!

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:33.980
A mecha Lala made suddenly broke down and started malfunctioning.

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:35.110
Lala-san's?

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:38.530
Lock on.

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:42.030
Eh?

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:49.710
Gulp.

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:51.920
Why you...!

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:56.920
Mikado-sensei, are you okay?!

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:58.920
Yeah, somehow.

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:01.800
Oh?

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:08.430
What are you doing, Celine?!

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:11.310
It's fine.

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:15.320
Celine-chan always does this when she gets bored.

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:17.030
What are you saying so casually?!

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:18.820
Do you want to try sucking too?

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:23.280
Give me my panties back, you!

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:31.210
It's...!

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:33.330
This is bad, we have to catch it!

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:36.340
Mikado-sensei, I'll leave Celine to you!

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:38.960
Oh no, this is terrible!

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:50.390
H-Hey, what is that?!

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:52.980
That design... one of Lala-chan's inventions?

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:04.740
It's a cleaning mecha and yet it's making a mess everywhere.

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:06.830
I thought it might be completely broken.

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:08.240
We have to hurry up and stop it.

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:12.000
Swallow.

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:15.000
What is this thing?!

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:15.960
Saki-sama!

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:16.960
Damn you!

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:18.960
Give her clothes back!

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:25.180
Stop it! Stop...!

00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:26.260
That voice...!

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:28.640
Kujou-senpai, are you okay?!

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:38.270
Don't look!

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:45.450
T-This is terrible!

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:47.280
What do I do?

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:51.120
The reason that mechanism broke is probably because of my telekinesis.

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:53.370
This is getting interesting, isn't it?

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:54.410
Mea-san!

00:12:54.410 --> 00:12:56.080
Now that I think about it, the root cause is you!

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:00.840
There's no time for arguing.

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:03.300
Stopping that mechanism comes first!

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:04.800
Huh, me too?

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:06.090
Of course!

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:08.430
I can't do it.

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:12.680
Stopping that mecha is impossible while I'm pretending to be an Earthling.

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:16.350
If I use my abilities, my identity will be found out by everyone at school.

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:19.190
So it's okay to leave it be because of that?!

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:20.860
It's fine, isn't it?

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:23.490
It's good to have some stimulation like this once in a while.

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:26.240
I've had enough!

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:32.830
I don't have any choice...

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:37.620
I wonder if it was too soon.

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:40.460
To tell Nana about the Harem Plan.

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:43.050
Did I rush it...?

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:47.880
I felt like I was falling behind Nana and Onee-sama with Rito-san...

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:50.300
T-That's not right.

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:56.060
I'm making Nana more strongly conscious of
Rito-san by conveying my seriousness to her.

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:57.890
That's the goal!

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:01.770
Hm?

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:03.570
Yami-san, is something the matter?

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:07.450
It seems there's some kind of disturbance going on.

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:09.820
<b> Girls' Locker Room</b>

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:09.820
 llllllllllllllllllll

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:12.620
I wonder what happened to Oshizu-chan.

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:14.370
It's been a while, Run-chan! {background}

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:14.330
She has to hurry up and get changed.

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:15.910
Gym class is next.

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:16.250
Yeah, it's been a while! {background}

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:17.960
She's always spacing out.

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:20.080
I'm going to go take a look.

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:26.010
I caught you, you bastard!

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:27.510
Now listen to me!!

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:28.630
What's going on?

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:30.970
Ouch...

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:33.890
If I don't hurry up and catch it, I get the feeling I won't be able to hold out.

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:36.390
Stop, damn it!

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:36.390
Nana!

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:37.640
Are you okay?!

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:06.420
Ah, Rito-kun...

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:12.430
S-Shameless!

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:14.220
Wait!

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:16.180
I'm not holding back anymore!

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:24.650
Rito-kun, you're so bold!

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:25.860
Rito!

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:26.980
Let's go, you beast!

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:28.990
Get a hold of yourself!

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:35.330
Good grief.

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:35.910
Come on.

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:37.870
Huh?

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:40.370
What is that?

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:42.460
Nana! What's going on?

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:43.630
Momo!

00:15:43.630 --> 00:15:48.340
Big sister's mecha suddenly malfunctioned and I had no choice but to destroy it, but...

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:50.340
Now something strange is coming from inside.

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:53.470
Yami-san, this is...!

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:55.720
There's some kind of unpleasant aura.

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:58.140
Huh?

00:15:58.140 --> 00:16:00.100
None of you have got changed yet?

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:01.850
Class is about to start!

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:02.520
Lala-san!

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:03.730
Hold on!

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:06.020
That's one of your inventions, isn't it?

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:12.400
Go-Go-Vacuum-Kun-Anglerfish is broken?!

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:14.570
That's a micro black hole!

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:16.830
Did you say black hole?!

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:19.330
It's Vacuum-Kun-Anglerfish's power source!

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:20.660
This is terrible!

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:24.210
The containment apparatus is broken and it's outside!

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:27.090
Isn't that dangerous, Lala-san?

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:28.550
It is.

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:33.090
But it's small, so I think it'll disappear once it uses up its energy.

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:37.430
It might have enough power to suck in this entire school, though.

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:42.020
D-Don't use such a dangerous thing for a power source!

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:42.850
Now, now.

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:44.230
I'm sorry!

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:46.860
I was too concerned with the suction power so it just turned out that way!

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:55.530
It seems staying away is a good idea.

00:16:55.530 --> 00:16:57.120
But at this rate...!

00:16:59.990 --> 00:17:01.830
Telekinetic convergence!

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:05.920
Oshizu!

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:09.040
I'll suppress it with my telekinesis and extinguish it!

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:19.050
I'm the cause of this situation...!

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:22.310
Mikado-sensei told me about it.

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:28.060
If I exhaust too much life energy, I will cease to exist.

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:34.440
But I have to protect the school and everyone in it!

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:37.700
Even if it means I have to disappear!

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:02.310
Just a little more...!

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:04.680
Just a little more...!

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:05.980
But...!

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:09.190
Oshizu-chan!

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:12.610
I'm already...!

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:15.440
I guess I don't have a choice...

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:16.320
Eh?!

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:51.310
It's gone...

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:55.780
Mea-san...

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:57.570
I didn't have a choice, right?

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:01.110
There's no point if the school disappears.

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:05.790
W-What's with her?

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:07.330
What was that just now...?

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:09.210
Her hand transformed.

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:13.040
I-It's just like...

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:14.750
It's not that...!

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:15.800
She's... Um...

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:23.300
She's...

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:34.110
my little sister.

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:40.110
Yami-chan's...

00:19:40.450 --> 00:19:42.110
...little sister?

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:47.620
She's not blood-related, but she has the same trans ability.

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:51.250
We were separated for many years,

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:54.130
but we were able to meet again at this school.

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:57.840
Please take care of her from now on as well.

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:12.310
Yami-chan's little sister!

00:20:12.310 --> 00:20:14.150
That outfit is irresistible!

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:15.900
She fired a beam from her hand!

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:17.610
I fell for her right there!

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:19.320
Kurosaki-san!

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:20.610
You were so cool!

00:20:20.610 --> 00:20:22.610
Mea!

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:24.320
I told you, didn't I?

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:27.120
That there's no one here you'd have to worry about.

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:34.000
It's true.

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:37.380
They're all so naive.

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:40.380
Thank you, Yami-oneechan.

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:44.180
That's the first time you've called me your little sister, isn't it?

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:47.970
I'm... not really...

00:20:57.980 --> 00:21:00.570
What's with Yami...?

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:04.240
It seems like she suddenly got embarrassed.

00:21:04.900 --> 00:21:06.200
Murasame-senpai.

00:21:08.320 --> 00:21:13.250
We were able to stop the micro black hole because of both our powers.

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:16.830
Once again, please take care of me from now on.

00:21:19.670 --> 00:21:20.340
Yes!

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:32.390
Oh!

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:35.350
When you get surprised something happens for sure, huh?

00:21:35.350 --> 00:21:38.190
Please don't treat me like a toy!

00:21:38.190 --> 00:21:39.270
How wonderful!

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:41.820
Would you please learn a little...!

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:48.200
Y-You beast!

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:53.700
Ah... It looks like progress is going to take some time.

